  "reason": "Evidence: The best configuration found is config_006 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted, 0.7250 acc, 3.60 GPU hrs). All four aggregation×fusion combinations with this top encoder pair have been tested. The next-best encoder pair (scvi_n200 + resnet50) has been tested with transformer+weighted (0.7131) and transformer+concat (0.6878), but the avgpool+weighted combination remains untested. This experiment tests whether the weighted-fusion advantage (consistent across all other pairings) holds with avgpool aggregation and resnet50, completing the systematic exploration of the scvi_n200 multiprofile multimodal space. It is the best use of the final experiment because: (1) it fills the last logical gap in the most promising architecture family, (2) it is relatively cheap (avgpool + resnet50 expected ~4.0–4.5 GPU hrs, comparable to config_046's 4.82 hrs), and (3) while unlikely to surpass 0.7250, it provides confirmation that config_006 is the optimal choice and rules out a cheaper near-equivalent, solidifying the final recommendation with minimal additional cost."
